{"id":"suzhdeno","lemma":"суждено","pos":"adj","rank":2305,"glosses":["it is destined, it is fated"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ей суждено было умереть молодой.","en":"It was her fate to die young.","words":[{"g":"(to) her"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to die of natural causes"},{"g":"young"}]},{"text":"Всем нам суждено умереть.","en":"We're all bound to die.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"весь"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"to die of natural causes"}]},{"text":"Нам суждено было встретиться.","en":"We were destined to meet.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to meet"}]},{"text":"Возможно, нам просто не суждено было быть вместе.","en":"Maybe we just weren't meant to be together.","words":[{"g":"perhaps"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"together"}]},{"text":"Нам было суждено встретиться.","en":"We were destined to meet.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to meet"}]}]}